      "en": "INDEXING SCHEME RELATING TO ASPECTS OF THE CHARGES OR FURNACES, KILNS, OVENS OR RETORTS<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This subclass constitutes an internal scheme for indexing only.",
